{"id":"34c60c3bc15859dd","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pbnf.md","title":"Pseudo-Boolean normal forms and posiforms","display":"df-pbnf — Pseudo-Boolean normal forms and posiforms","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pbnf","aliases":["27-df-pbnf"],"display":"df-pbnf — Pseudo-Boolean normal forms and posiforms","depends_on":["[[27-df-pseudobool]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.2","source_statement":"Definitions 13.2–13.3, Equation (13.15)","source_printed_pages":"572","source_pdf_pages":"596","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pbnf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pbnf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pbnf — Pseudo-Boolean normal forms and posiforms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.2"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Definitions 13.2–13.3, Equation (13.15)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"572"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"596"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a>）。空积取 1，空和取 0。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBEval}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PBEval}_n\\)</span> 是本节定义的求值映射符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBNF}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\left\\{(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\;\\middle|\\;b_0\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;(b_k\\in\\mathbb R\\land A_k,B_k\\subseteq N\\land A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing\\land A_k\\cup B_k\\neq\\varnothing)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBNF}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\left\\{(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\;\\middle|\\;b_0\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;(b_k\\in\\mathbb R\\land A_k,B_k\\subseteq N\\land A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing\\land A_k\\cup B_k\\neq\\varnothing)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBEval}_n:\\mathrm{PBNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n,\\quad\\mathrm{PBEval}_n\\left((b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\right)(x)\\coloneqq b_0+\\sum_{k=1}^m b_k\\left(\\prod_{i\\in A_k}x_i\\right)\\left(\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-x_j)\\right)\\quad\\left(m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ (b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n,\\ x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBEval}_n:\\mathrm{PBNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n,\\quad\\mathrm{PBEval}_n\\left((b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\right)(x)\\coloneqq b_0+\\sum_{k=1}^m b_k\\left(\\prod_{i\\in A_k}x_i\\right)\\left(\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-x_j)\\right)\\quad\\left(m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ (b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n,\\ x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\{(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n\\mid\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;(b_k&gt;0)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\{(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n\\mid\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;(b_k&gt;0)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definitions 13.2–13.3。PBNF 可含补变量，同一函数可有多个 PBNF；posiform 仅要求非常数项的系数严格为正，常数项 b_0 可取任何实数。序列编码保留重复项，区别于 DNF 的集合编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pseudobool]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；$\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（see [[27-df-pseudobool]]）。空积取 1，空和取 0。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBEval}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBNF}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\left\\{(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\;\\middle|\\;b_0\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;(b_k\\in\\mathbb R\\land A_k,B_k\\subseteq N\\land A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing\\land A_k\\cup B_k\\neq\\varnothing)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBEval}_n:\\mathrm{PBNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n,\\quad\\mathrm{PBEval}_n\\left((b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\right)(x)\\coloneqq b_0+\\sum_{k=1}^m b_k\\left(\\prod_{i\\in A_k}x_i\\right)\\left(\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-x_j)\\right)\\quad\\left(m\\in\\mathbb N,\\ (b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n,\\ x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\{(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n\\mid\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;(b_k>0)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1992,"backlinks":[{"id":"0a60d76d37648fa4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n$（见 [[27-df-pbnf]]）。空和为0。"},{"id":"ec9751f6536e0aa8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Posiform}_n,\\mathrm{PBEval}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbnf]]。"},{"id":"0c5e4aaa7e95ef90","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n$，见 [[27-df-pbnf]]；$[m]=\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}$。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-289","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pbnf|df-pbnf — Pseudo-Boolean normal forms and posiforms]]"},{"id":"adff775aa909263a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n$，$f=\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P)$；$F_P,\\mathcal L(P)$ 见 [[27-df-pblplinearization]]，$\\mathrm{PBNF}_n,\\mathrm{PBEval}_n$ 取其上游 [[27-df-pbnf]]。"},{"id":"56a0ce4b212a48f4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$\\mathrm{PBEval}_n,\\mathrm{Posiform}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbnf]]，有限立方体极值见 [[27-df-pbopt]]。$\\operatorname{Const}:\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\to\\mathbb R$ 与 $\\mu\\in\\mathbb R$ 由下式定义；$(c,\\sigma)$ 采用该 Posiform 定义的有序对编码。"},{"id":"c576c358aa272616","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n$，$f=\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P)$；$\\mathrm{Posiform}_n,\\mathrm{PBEval}_n$ 及冲突图的 $\\mathcal I_P,\\alpha_P$ 见 [[27-df-pbposiconflict]] 及其上游 [[27-df-pbnf]]。"},{"id":"21a8232d53c3a8a7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$\\mathrm{Posiform}_n$、$\\mathrm{PBEval}_n$（see [[27-df-pbnf]]），$c_f$ 及多线性表示（see [[27-thm-pbpoly]]）。"}],"outgoing":["04a7d534f0d6e0dd"]}